Easy MP2RAGE
GPL-3.0-or-later

The T1 lookup, B1 correction, SA2RAGE B1 mapping and robust-combination
denoising are a Rust port of the T1-mapping parts of Jose Marques'
MP2RAGE-related-scripts:
https://github.com/JosePMarques/MP2RAGE-related-scripts

Please cite Marques et al. 2010 (NeuroImage), Marques and Gruetter 2013
(PLoS ONE), Eggenschwiler et al. 2012 (Magn Reson Med) and O'Brien et al.
2014 (PLoS ONE).
